WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.290
Two places.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:04.370
One learning journey.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.810
Pro Trader Academy is where you learn.

00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:09.233
Explore short guides.

00:00:10.108 --> 00:00:10.868
Follow lessons.

00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:12.538
Save practice notes.

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:14.355
And ask your instructor questions.

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:17.328
Pro Trader is your chart analysis workspace.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:21.570
Open the app from the website navigation to
explore

00:00:21.972 --> 00:00:23.632
the tools discussed in your lessons.

00:00:24.572 --> 00:00:26.152
The Academy and app have separate sign-ins.

00:00:28.197 --> 00:00:30.737
Joining the Academy does not open a broker
account

00:00:31.138 --> 00:00:32.338
or connect MetaTrader.

00:00:32.722 --> 00:00:34.502
Start with one lesson.

00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:36.033
Explore the relevant tool.

00:00:36.822 --> 00:00:38.822
Then return to your notes and explain what
you

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:39.670
observed.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:41.890
Learn in the Academy.

00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:43.865
Explore in the app.

00:00:45.072 --> 00:00:46.512
Build a process you can explain.
